## Title: Guild Market Scanner DEV
## Description: Low-memory streaming weekly preparation for large PS-EU market scans. Prevents the weekly exporter from duplicating tens of thousands of item rows in Lua memory, while keeping frame-safe trader commits, trusted/observed prices, Top-25 guild opportunities, D1 transport, and the existing weekly browser workflow.
